{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Your First Night at Corbaci.</strong> <br><i>Where the soup is hot, and reality simmers on the edge.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>free demo</strong> lets you play the <strong>first night</strong> of <i>Corbaci: A Cozy Cinematic Horror</i>\u2014a small taste of a surreal culinary nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You run a quaint little soup shop.<br>Customers come in. You serve soup. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not quite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Use the <strong>Super Soup 2000</strong> to craft soups from mysterious ingredients.<br>\u00a0Watch closely for <strong>anomalies</strong> in your shop\u2014shifts in sound, shadow, or logic.<br>\u00a0Serve your customers, listen to their eerie stories, and <strong>try not to blink too long.</strong><br>\u00a0Enjoy a cozy yet deeply unsettling <strong>blend of cinematic horror and light management gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will take you deeper into the strange, looping nights of Corbaci. But for now\u2026 <br><strong>Just survive the first shift.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And remember:<br>Some things come back to the shop more than once.<br>Even if you never served them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3752700?t=1749473956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752700/e0cb0012c32c40572ca853504fc0732109a06544/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749473956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752700/c46422033f42c48a7e77a5382797e43d4ca1e180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749473956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752700/c46422033f42c48a7e77a5382797e43d4ca1e180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749473956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"descripti